  "Scenes.Loppe.SureBakeryWithLoppe.SurprisedByAppetite": "[pg]You tell her that you aren't, you just didn't expect her to have such an appetite. With a playful smile, you ask what other not-so-dainty secrets she's hiding; does she burp loudly to show she enjoyed her meal? Loppe smiles mischievously, [say: Oh, my sweet [boy]... When I get my hands on something I like, I eat it up whole...] Slowly, you feel a foot gently glide across your [legs]."
