  "Scenes.Loppe.TalkWithLoppeAboutLoppe.BraveButFoolish": "[pg]You tell her that was very brave - but very foolish. How did she know the demon would actually keep her word? What made her think she could actually win a contest like that, anyway?"
  "Scenes.Loppe.TalkWithLoppeAboutLoppe.BunnySpeciesLore": "[pg]Loppe shakes her head. [say: There are actually more than one species of bunny in this world. You may have seen the cute ones with the ears and human faces... my father was a bit more like our animal cousins; fuzzy, cuddly... also lethal with a sword, though that's less related. All the fun stuff.]"
