  "Scenes.Loppe.TalkWithLoppeAboutLoppe.CurseMentioned": "[pg][say: Flatterer... To tell the truth I used to look a lot more like my dad, but then came the curse...]"
  "Scenes.Loppe.TalkWithLoppeAboutLoppe.DemonAmbushBargain": "[pg][say: On our trip to this place, we were ambushed by a demon... I had to protect my mother, so I offered myself as the demon's willing sex toy if she would let my mother go. Of course my mother protested, but the demon silenced her by tying her up with black magic. Then she proposed a challenge. She said I could pick a game and if she managed to win the game, both my mother and I would become her slaves; if I won, we could both go.] Loppe's eyes glint with mischief."
