  "Scenes.Loppe.TalkWithLoppeAboutLoppe.TakesAfterDad": "[pg]You tell her that from what her mom says, Loppe definitely must take after her dad's side of the family, giving her a winsome grin. Loppe smiles at you."
  "Scenes.Loppe.TalkWithLoppeAboutLoppe.TakesAfterFather": "[pg]Loppe grins at you. [say: Well, I do take after my father in more ways than one. Mom is a normal female. She's actually a lesbian, and didn't know about my father being a herm. You can imagine her surprise when she found out.] She giggles. [say: Though my mother might prefer girls, I don't think she minded my father's extra bits... otherwise I wouldn't be here now, would I?]"
  "Scenes.Loppe.TalkWithLoppeAboutLoppe.TribeAttacked": "[pg][say: Okay, moving on... Our tribe, like many others, was attacked by demons. I managed to escape along with my mother, but it was tough finding a new place to settle down, and the wilderness is very dangerous. So we traveled, seeking a place of safety, until we heard of Tel'Adre.] Loppe's usually happy face suddenly becomes apprehensive."
  "Scenes.Loppe.TalkWithLoppeAboutLoppe.UnusualUpbringing": "[pg]Loppe smiles, not insulted, and shrugs her shoulders. [say: Well, it's unusual, I can tell you that... Although I have never been treated differently because of my mixed blood. Mom says my father was just the cutest bunny there is, it was love at first sight.]"
  "Scenes.Loppe.TalkWithLoppeAboutLoppe.WhereToBegin": "[pg]Loppe acknowledges your gesture and scratches her own in thought. [say: Hmm. Where do I begin... I suppose my family is as good a start as any. I was born in a small village to the far east. We were a tiny but friendly community; my mother was a healer specializing in the traditional medicine of our ancestors. My father... well, I never met my father. But as you can tell, I'm a mix of leporid and equine... a laquine, if you will,] she finishes with a giggle."
