  "Scenes.Loppe.TalkWithLoppeAboutWorking.MasseuseTraining": "[pg]Loppe smiles and shakes her head. [say: Well, I am training to become a proficient masseuse and acupuncturist. Most of my income comes from dancing though, which is why I work so hard to maintain my figure. But I've always admired mom's work... and if I learned her trade I'd be able to take some weight off her shoulders, plus we'd get to spend more time together.]"
  "Scenes.Loppe.TalkWithLoppeAboutWorking.StudyAnatomyFirst": "[pg]Loppe taps her chin in thought when you prompt her for more details. [say: Well... first I have to know all the pressure points in the body of the patient; which is not easy since there is a wide variety in species, plus the cases of mutation when you have someone with body-parts from different species. Then I have to know how to read the flow of the patient's body, which means I have to know what each reaction from the pressure points means. Then I need to learn how much pressure, or how many needles, are needed to fix that particular problem. Then I analyze the patient's energy flow again... and, well, it's complicated.] She grins nervously."
  "Scenes.Loppe.TalkWithLoppeAboutWorking.TuckFactAway": "[pg]You nod your head in understanding, and tuck that fact away in the back of your head. Realizing how much time has passed, you politely tell Loppe that it's time to go."
